2. The diary readings and source rights
-----------------------------------------------------
The daily readings, topics, and weekly themes in public/data/diary-entries.json
are drawn from *The Spiritual Diary of Paramahansa Yogananda*, published by
Self-Realization Fellowship (Los Angeles, CA). Copyrighted SRF writings remain
© Self-Realization Fellowship. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. The four additions documented
in docs/SOURCE_GAPS.md use underlying public-domain Bible and 1946 Autobiography
text, with explicitly recorded card variants. This notice does not claim a new
copyright over those public-domain passages.

This text is NOT covered by the MIT License and is NOT dedicated to the public
domain. It is reproduced here with reverence, for personal, non-commercial,
devotional reading only — one reading per day, in the spirit of the printed
book. Upon acceptance of this donation by Self-Realization Fellowship, the
diary text and its presentation are governed entirely by SRF.

The reader has been built with these disciplines (see docs/ATTRIBUTION.md):
  • No Yogananda content is ever scraped, OCR'd from unauthorized scans, or
    generated/paraphrased by an AI model. Missing days are filled from
    supplied pages or permitted sources, with source and edition limits recorded.
  • The application is never sold, monetized, or ad-supported.


3. Names, marks, and imagery
----------------------------
"Self-Realization Fellowship," "SRF," "Paramahansa Yogananda," and the SRF
emblem are the property of Self-Realization Fellowship. They are referred to in
this project only nominatively, for accurate attribution.

The lotus icon used by this app (public/lotus-icon.svg and the generated
branding icons) is an ORIGINAL, generic lotus mark created for this project. It
is deliberately NOT the SRF emblem — it has no star and no lettering — so that
it cannot be mistaken for an official SRF mark. Should SRF adopt this gift, SRF
may replace it with the official SRF emblem.


